    "title": {
     "label": "Duoling"
    },
    "content": {
     "label": "Hello, now that I understand Duolingo and don’t write like a second grader, here is my report as a 7th grader with a college reading level and straight A’s for 4 years….\n     Duolingo is truly helpful, I always thought a cutesy app with a green owl wouldn’t do diddly-squat for me. Boy was I wrong, it does do a lot for you, from explaining your mistakes. To even giving you helpful boosts during learning time. However, I dislike how Super Duolingo is $10 a month! I am a child, so I have no idea how bad this economy is, but I ain’t tryna pay that!! If I’m 4.2x more likely to finish a course with super, give me it!! Overall, great app, I will never understand this…I am using it for my Japan trip next year, overall, get it, be prepared to spend money as you don’t need a pass to learn….GET RID OF THE BATTERY SYSTEM,I WANNA LEARN ALL DAY!",
     "attributes": {
      "type": "text"
     }
    },
